<body data-time="future">
  <header class="site"><div class="wrap bar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">Tercet <b>Law</b></a>
    <nav class="navlinks"><a href="/services">Services</a><a href="/pricing">Pricing</a><a href="/process">Process</a><a href="/about">About</a><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a call</a></nav>
  </div></header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past">Past</span><span class="tw present">Present</span><span class="tw future on">Future</span></div>
        <h1>Wills, trusts, and a plan <em>for your family.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Tercet Law does estate planning with flat fees: your will, your trust, your health directive, and a plan you can actually live by. Plan it. Leave it better.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a planning call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#how">How it works</a></div>
        <p class="welcome" hidden>Welcome to Tercet Law · The future · <b>Live</b> on purpose</p>
      </div><div class="hero-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582213782179-e0d53f98f2ca?w=1400&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Family members stacking hands together" width="1400" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" /></div></div>
      <div class="proof"><div class="wrap proof-grid"><div><b>3</b><span>Documents every adult needs</span></div><div><b>Flat</b><span>Fees, quoted up front</span></div><div><b>1</b><span>Attorney, start to finish</span></div><div><b>TX</b><span>Texas practice (Alabama licensed)</span></div></div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="sec gallery-sec faces"><div class="wrap gallery"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521791136064-7986c2920216?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A couple meeting with their attorney" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The plan</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1609220136736-443140cffec6?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A family at the dinner table" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The family</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511895426328-dc8714191300?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A family walking on the beach" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>What it protects</figcaption></figure></div></section>
    <section class="sec" id="why"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">The problem</p><h2>Everyone means to do it.<br>Most never do.</h2></div>
      <div class="pains"><div class="pain"><h3>Unwritten</h3><p>No will. No directive. A family left guessing.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Unfunded</h3><p>A trust on paper that owns nothing.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Unlived</h3><p>A plan that was never a plan to live on.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec"><div class="wrap gallery"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450101499163-c8848c66ca85?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Hands signing a document" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The documents</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589829545856-d10d557cf95f?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A statue of Lady Justice" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The law</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581579186913-45ac3e6efe93?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Three generations of a family with their dog" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The legacy</figcaption></figure></div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="russ"><div class="wrap guide-grid">
      <img src="/russ-michaels.jpg" alt="Russ Michaels" width="340" height="425" loading="lazy" />
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Your attorney</p><h2>Russ Michaels</h2><p class="lede">An attorney since 2014, based in Texas. Twenty years leading organizations alongside the practice. He treats your plan as the start of a life, not the end of one.</p><blockquote>Sometimes we meet life where it is, not where we are. We hold that together.</blockquote><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.vaulthuman.com/writing">Writing</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Three steps.</h2></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>The call</h3><p>Thirty minutes. What you have, what you want, what it costs.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>The plan</h3><p>One flat fee. Will, trust, health directive, powers of attorney. Done right.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>The life</h3><p>A plan is only useful if you live it. Coaching at Vault Human is there if you want it.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="pricing"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p><h2>Flat fees. No surprises.</h2></div>
      <div class="offers"><div class="offer feat"><div class="tag">Start here</div><h3>The Essentials</h3><div class="price">From $1,500</div><p>Will, health directive, powers of attorney. Signed and explained.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="/pricing">See pricing</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">Most chosen</div><h3>The Trust Plan</h3><div class="price">Quoted</div><p>Revocable trust, funded. Everything in the Essentials.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="/pricing">See pricing</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">For business owners</div><h3>Succession</h3><div class="price">Quoted</div><p>Who runs the company if you can't. Buy-sell, operating agreements, the hand-off.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="/pricing">See pricing</a></div></div>
      
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="family"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Past · Present · Future</p><h2>Part of Vault Human.</h2><p class="lede">A tercet is three lines that belong together. So is a plan: your will, your trust, and the directive that says what you want. Tercet Law is the law firm inside the Vault Human family. It is a law firm, not coaching. Coaching is a separate thing you can choose later.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-rail"></div>
      <div class="tl-cards"><a class="tlc brown" href="https://www.fretworksystems.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Learn · The past</div><h3>Fretwork</h3><p>Fixes how your work runs: tools, workflows, AI. Not a coach. Not a law firm.</p><span>fretworksystems.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc green" href="https://triplicityadvisory.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Love · The present</div><h3>Triplicity</h3><p>The coaching company. Runs every Vault Human coaching program.</p><span>triplicityadvisory.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc navy me" href="https://www.tercetlaw.com"><div class="when">Live · The future</div><h3>Tercet</h3><p>The law firm. Wills, trusts, and a plan for your family. Not coaching.</p><span>tercetlaw.com ↗</span></a></div>
      <p class="constant">The Constant: <a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Vault Human</a> — Listen.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>What does Tercet do?</summary><p>Estate planning: wills, trusts, health directives, powers of attorney, business succession. Flat fees.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need a trust?</summary><p>Sometimes. The call tells you honestly, and the price is the same either way.</p></details><details><summary>Where are you licensed?</summary><p>Alabama, with Texas admission pending. Based in Austin. Virtual appointments.</p></details><details><summary>What is Vault Human?</summary><p>Daily coaching, run by the same owner. It is separate from your legal work and never required.</p></details></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final" id="begin"><div class="wrap">
      <h2>Book a planning call.</h2><p class="lede">Thirty minutes. You leave knowing what you need and exactly what it costs.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a planning call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site">
    <div class="wrap foot">
      <div><a class="brand" href="/">Tercet <b>Law</b></a><p>Wills, trusts, and a plan for your family. Flat fees.</p><p><a href="mailto:russ@tercetlaw.com">russ@tercetlaw.com</a> · <a href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></p></div>
      <ul><li><a href="/services">Services</a></li><li><a href="/pricing">Pricing</a></li><li><a href="/process">Process</a></li><li><a href="/about">About</a></li><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></li></ul>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Vault Human</a> — Listen</li><li><a href="https://www.fretworksystems.com">Fretwork</a> — Learn · the past</li><li><a href="https://triplicityadvisory.com">Triplicity</a> — Love · the present</li><li><a href="https://www.tercetlaw.com">Tercet Law</a> — Live · the future</li></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap legal"><span>&copy; {year} Tercet Law PLLC. Attorney advertising. No representation is formed by this site.</span><span>Part of the Vault Human family</span></div>
  </footer>

